      <description><![CDATA[<h3>0.2.1</h3>
<p>A repair release for three things 0.2.0 got wrong.</p>
<ul>
  <li><b>&ldquo;Buy&rdquo; and &ldquo;Website&rdquo; went nowhere</b> — the
      address built into 0.2.0 did not exist.</li>
  <li><b><code>user@host:port</code> was read as one hostname</b>, so
      <code>deploy@10.0.0.5:2222</code> could not connect.</li>
  <li><b>The host key fingerprint wrapped mid-string</b>, which is the one
      thing that sheet exists to let you compare.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
